  "items": [
    {
      "_id": "0MCHPWtHQwHK5AjE",
      "name": "Staff of the Black Desert",
      "type": "weapon",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/staves/staff-of-the-black-desert.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "folder": null,
      "sort": 0,
      "flags": {
        "core": {}
      },
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>This rough metal staff is pitted and sandblasted, with thousands of nigh-imperceptible sand crystals embedded in its surface.</p>\n<p>While carrying the staff, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Occultism checks to identify aberrations and oozes native to the Darklands.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cantrip</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.tXa5vOu5giBNCjdR]{Know Direction}<br /><strong>1st</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.WzLKjSw6hsBhuklC]{Create Water} @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.qXTB7Ec9yYh5JPPV]{Purify Food and Drink} @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.xqmHD8JIjak15lRk]{Unseen Servant}</li>\n<li><strong>2nd</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.pZTqGY1MLRjgKasV]{Darkvision} @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.5esP2GVzvxWsMgaX]{Endure Elements}</li>\n<li><strong>3rd</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.gPvtmKMRpg9I9D7H]{Earthbind} @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0]{Neutralize Poison} @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.ppA1StEigPLKEQqR]{Wanderer's Guide}</li>\n<li><strong>4th</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.b5sGjGlBf58f8jn0]{Air Walk} @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.HBJPsonQnWcC3qdX]{Hallucinatory Terrain} @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.GzdgM0m7wXKuFSho]{Rope Trick}</li>\n<li><strong>5th</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.qr0HOiiuqj5LKlDt]{Pillars of Sand} @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.hkfH9Z53hPzcOwNB]{Veil}</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Automatically applied effects:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+2 circumstance bonus to Occultism checks to identify aberrations and oozes native to the Darklands</li>\n</ul>",
          "chat": "",
          "unidentified": ""
        },
        "rules": [
          {
            "key": "FlatModifier",
            "label": "Staff of the Black Desert (identify oozes & aberrations of Darklands)",
            "predicate": [
              "action:recall-knowledge",
              "identify",
              "target:native-darklands",
              {
                "or": [
                  "target:ooze",
                  "target:aberration"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "selector": "occultism",
            "type": "circumstance",
            "value": 2
          }
        ],
